| `LH-04` | Apple Pie | Apple ester/green-fruit module plus restrained baked spice/pastry shadow | Ginger, violet-green tailoring, cedar and vetiver remain dominant architecture | Candy apple, cinnamon dessert, or vanillic gourmand takeover |
| `LH-05` | Ginger-Cedrat Spark | Expanded fresh ginger-citron tension | Violet-green and cedar-tonka body unchanged | Thin cologne or sport-fresh drift |
| `LH-06` | Violet Leaf Silk | More tactile violet-leaf/ionone-green heart | Ginger opening and cedar-vetiver base unchanged | Iris powder or cucumber-green literalism |
